  "description": "When a perpetually overlooked supporting actor dies wishing to be jaw-droppingly handsome, he's reborn as Ma Gongja, a ridiculously beautiful baby who was left outside an orphanage. After a famous actress adopts him, Gongja suddenly has fame, fortune, and everyone falling for his cuteness, but he's just getting started! Armed with acting skills, this charming child is determined to become the most dazzling star there is, but will his stunning looks cause more trouble than he bargained for?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
